@* A section RCL does NOT inherit the host's Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. Omitting a line
   here ships broken markup with a green build and no runtime error — see design §1/§2.
   Guarded by the rendered-HTML diff in step 12. *@
@using Humans.Containers
@using Humans.Containers.Contracts
@using Humans.UI
@using Humans.UI.Extensions
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@inject IStringLocalizer<ContainersResource> Localizer
@* Genuinely shared strings (Common_*, Camp_Plural) stay in SharedResource — copying them
   into each section's .resx would duplicate them ~35 times. A section view that needs one
   uses SharedLocalizer explicitly, so which set a key comes from is visible at the call site.
   ContainerMap_* is CityPlanning's set, not Containers' — same rule applies. *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> SharedLocalizer
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, Humans.UI
